    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-λῠτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to sever,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				281a
			</span></i>; <i>destructive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				60b
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεννητικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					153b32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic.,
				<i>relaxing,</i>
			
