					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					3.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>embodying a settlement</i> or <i>compromise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμολογία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					154.1
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>.</div>
